hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1609","Narrated to us by Bisr bin Hilal as-Sawwaf, who said: Jafar, meaning bin Sulaiman ad-Dubai, narrated to us; he said: Thabit al-Bunani narrated to us, on the authority of Anas bin Malik (RA), who said: \The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) would hear the crying of a child with his mother"","" so he would recite a short or light chapter (of the Quran).\"""""""
